{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And Reuben answered.</b> At first it was in Joseph's mind to take Reuben, for he was the eldest of the brothers, for the law dictates that when many sin, the eldest is punished. And when he heard from their words that Reuben had said, <b>do not sin against the child</b>, he did not wish to cause him distress, and took Simeon, who was next in age after him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:25.074319708Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}